==Trivia==
*Within the game's code, there are five placeholder stages that are the exact same as those found in [[Here Be Dragons]], minus [[Pilaf Field]].
**This is likely because all UL sub-chapters beginning with Here Be Dragons have exactly 6 stages up until this point. While Pilaf Field would change into Aku Altar's Seal, the other levels would simply go unused instead of being turned into new stages for this sub-chapter.
*In theory, this is far as one can go without clearing Empire of Cats's third chapter, as it is required to unlock the stages for [[The Gates of Aku]].

